# GTFS feeds are downloaded and cached at runtime. They are large and
# regenerable; the 7-day TTL handles freshness.
state/gtfs_cache/

.DS_Store
*.log

# state/pipeline.db is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the source of truth and
# is committed every run, which also keeps the scheduled workflow alive.

# SFM-MERGE.md is tracked deliberately: it is the reasoning behind every stage
# decision and the work cannot be resumed elsewhere without it. Note the repo is
# public, so the neighborhood priority scores in it are visible.
